    "text": "Coletta E. Groen | Colonial Chapel Funeral Home & Crematory\nColetta E. Groen | Colonial Chapel Funeral Home & Crematory\nA Visitation will be held on Sunday, July 27, 2025, with a Funeral Service the following day at Colonial Chapel in Orland Park, Illinois. Interment will take place at Good Shepherd Cemetery. In lieu of flowers, donations to Lightways Hospice are appreciated. Coletta E. Groen will be deeply missed by her family, friends, and all those whose lives she touched.\nClick here to read the original obituary.",
